# AutoTrader EQUITY A1-B SHADOW - observation only, ZERO ORDER MUTATION.
#
# Install to /etc/autotrader/autotrader-a1b-shadow.env (0644 root:root).
#
# This file is deliberately NOT autotrader.env and NOT autotrader-shadow.env.
# The A1-B observer shares no configuration with the trading runtimes or the
# sibling V3+EDA-1 shadow: not the database, not the activation flag, not the
# runtime arguments.
#
# There is no AUTOTRADER_PAPER_TRADING_ENABLED here and there must never be
# one. The A1-B shadow has no execution path for it to authorize, and its
# service unit does not read /etc/autotrader/autotrader.trading.env at all -
# the ata1bshadow user cannot even open that file.
AUTOTRADER_EQUITY_A1B_SHADOW_DB=/var/lib/autotrader-equity-a1b-shadow/a1b-shadow.db
